  "details": "Opening open beta at a time when my friends activity is high resulted in the social menu failing to load at all. It remained broken even when I attempted to hit expand or reenter my home instance. Output log will be sent via ticket due to the sensitive contents (all friend updates seem to be logged).\nI noticed this exception in the logs which might be related:\n2020.10.17 08:57:46 Exception  -  ArgumentException: An item with the same key has already been added. Key: usr_dd830ad5-e014-4686-a596-cb4d232e6b3b\nSystem.Collections.Generic.Dictionary`2[TKey,TValue].TryInsert (TKey key, TValue value, System.Collections.Generic.InsertionBehavior behavior) (at <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0)\nSystem.Collections.Generic.Dictionary`2[TKey,TValue].Add (TKey key, TValue value) (at <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0)\nVRC.UI.FriendsListManager+ǄǅǄǄǅǄǅǅǄǅǅǅǄǅǅǅǅǄǄǄǄǅǄǄǄǅǅǅǄǄǅǅǄǄǄǄǅǅǅǄǄǅǄǅǄǅǅ.MoveNext () (at <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0)\nUnityEngine.SetupCoroutine.InvokeMoveNext (System.Collections.IEnumerator enumerator, System.IntPtr returnValueAddress) (at <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0)",
